// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - HuaTov 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2380525097" "<color orange>Hua Tov coughs, seeming to be badly injured from not only your fight but from previous wounds. He was in no shape to even fight you in the first place.</color><br><br>I'm... sorry... {HeroName}... I don't know what overcame me...<br><br>You've been trying to... destroy Mot all of this time... and yet the Tsoo... we believed we were the only ones who could do it. Tub Ci has gone mad... and all of us willingly followed him... how many have we killed... have we <i>sacrificed</i>... to get where we are...?<br><br> It is not noble... it is not honorable... we were supposed to be better than... common gangsters... I wanted to... I WANTED to be better...<br><br>Tub Ci has fled to a local sewer system... he has the god-killer sword... p-please, you must stop him... you must save Astoria and the world from him...<br><br>But before you go... {HeroName}... do you think... do you think the Tsoo... that <i>I</i>... can be forgiven... for everything that I've done? For all the horrors that I've caused...?"
// Answer Text :
"P2222966696" "You can be forgiven, Hua, if you want to be, if you are truly repentant."
// Answer Text :
"P2402097096" "You've done too much to be forgiven, Hua."
// Answer Text :
"P1507474733" "I don't have the right to judge you, Hua. You have to decide for yourself."
// Page Forgive Text :
"P1785278715" "<color orange>Hua Tov lets out a small, weak smile</color><br><br>I... do... want to be... forgiven.<br><br>Thank you... {HeroName}...<br><br><color orange>Hua Tov collapses, the life leaving his body.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"
// Page NoForgiveness Text :
"P3876153900" "<color orange>Hua Tov remains silent at your words. A few moments later, a maw of Mot appears, devouring Hua!</color>"
// Page ForgiveHimself Text :
"P4132157979" "<color orange>Hua Tov remains silent at your words. A few moments later, a maw of Mot appears, devouring Hua! It seems on his own, Hua Tov could not bring himself to choose hope or forgiveness.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3294070784" "Our first order of business has to be the Tsoo. Protean is working within their organization to gather the components needed to summon Tielekku, but there is only so much he can do. If we do not prevent them from summoning the goddess, they will weaken her power, leaving us without a way to banish Mot.<br><br>I believe in some twisted way Tub Ci thinks he is doing the right thing, but I fear his sanity has been corrupted by the will of Mot. The Tsoo have spent years in Dark Astoria fighting the forces of Mot. They have become jaded to the point in believing only <i>they</i> can stop the creature, going so far as to believe they are above a goddess."
// AcceptString :
"P2106331591" "So, we need to find Tub Ci and his god-killer sword."
// SendOffString :
"P1666813242" "Yes, exactly. Protean has reported to me where Tub Ci last was, which was in a storage warehouse that the Tsoo have for their new 'incarnate' powered ink. He should have the sword on him, as well.<br><br>We must get to that warehouse, recover any items to summon Tielekku, find Tub Ci, and take the sword from him. I can only assume this will happen with a thorough beating of Tub Ci. Afterwards, I will see if I can talk sense into him to join our cause, as he would make a worthy ally.<br><br>Myself and Scirocco will meet you at the warehouse; Scirocco is determined to do everything he can to rescue his lackey, Ice Mistral, and I believe he can be trusted as long as he has such a drive to his actions."
// TaskTitle :
"P3928044660" "<color deepskyblue>The Choice of Hope</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P878870853" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: The Long War</color>"

