// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3186179208" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>They will not get the chance. We shall slaughter {HeroName} and all who help {Hero.gender=male him|her}."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2716308887" "Our sisters fall one by one. We must stop this now."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2777545195" "{HeroName}, you have avoided us at every turn. Today it ends."

