// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3142103817" "<shout>You have prevented our justice from being enacted, {HeroName}. Death is too kind for you. We shall make you into one of us, and you shall serve us for eternity!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - MotherKeres 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3527605156" "Defeat the Mother Keres"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4161309956" "You defeated the Mother Keres!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2025204062" "You've destroyed the Mother Keres and the main base for the Talons of Vengeance!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4205219375" "Good to see you're alive, {HeroName}. I didn't think that was going to happen down there. What exactly happened when you vanished?<br><br>Hrm, a 'Mother Keres', you say? I'll have to look more into that to see just how many there are. It's possible you just delivered a major blow to the Talons as a whole, and not just the ones in Dark Astoria.<br><br><color yellow>Montague Castanella</color> has told me that there are several reports of the Talons of Vengeance retreating from various areas all over the world. They're most likely running scared now without this Mother Keres to guide them, {HeroName}. Now is the time to strike at Mot!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DreamDoctor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2914455262" "This is it, {HeroName}. We will march onto the graveyard of Mot and destroy him, once and for all.<br><br>Your power and Tielekku's presence will get us straight to the heart of the area, where we shall banish Mot from this world forever.<br><br>Are you ready?"
// Answer Text :
"P4060073399" "Let's go, Dream Doctor."
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3860205937" "This is it, {HeroName}. The ritual is nearly complete. Tub Ci and the Tsoo have agreed to help us in ending this, the Talons of Vengeance have been decimated, the Knives of Vengeance destroyed, and your immunity to Mot <i>should</i> still be present.<br><br>The Midnighters have confirmed that David Hazen's runes will work to empower our magical spell.<br><br>Are you ready, {HeroName}, to bring this to an end? It isn't going to be easy... not by a long shot. Mot is going to throw everything it has at us to stop our efforts, but we'll have you and the goddess Tielekku on our side, along with my entire team."
// AcceptString :
"P3482818633" "I'm ready, let's finish this."
// SendOffString :
"P3956280677" "Excellent. We'll meet you at the ritual site. By the time you arrive, we should be nearly finished with summoning Tielekku.<br><br><color orange>{Hero.type=hero If this is truly the final fight against Mot, you'll have to bring plenty of allies with you to see this to the end.|If this is truly the final fight against Mot, then this could be your chance to play your gambit. You can use the god-killer sword to take both Tielekku and Mot's power. With their abilities, no one else will be able to stand in your way!}"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P20386066" "Banish Mot to the Spirit World"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3232519191" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: To Destroy a God</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P416651135" "You can see the ritual being finished up ahead. Powerful magic fills the air, fighting against the despair that is seeping from the graveyard."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P4101646914" "Approach the summoning site"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2155138304" "Talk to Dream Doctor"
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1834987795" "We have to stay together to get out of here."
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2678280100" "We have to push through here and get away! Mot is more powerful than ever!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4263292762" "Text"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2163326861" "{HeroName}, just in time. The ritual is nearly complete. Tielekku! We summon you into this world!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2313614372" "Then there's no point in wasting any time. {HeroName}, speak with me, we move to destroy Mot, once and for all."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2973593613" "Ajax"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2430590139" "Tielekku"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P252212587" "Dream Doctor. It has been quite some time."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3165266361" "I have watched this from the spirit world. The Banished Pantheon gods are salivating. Mot's work will soon shatter the barrier between this world and their own."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3539282162" "Strange... I can sense... the Sentinel. There is something within that creature..."

