// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P36951789" "You saved Scirocco!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P631301169" "Madame Bellerose"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2716820489" "No... hope... only... Mot..."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4176946300" "You... I saw visions of you... twisted visions... you must die, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2181109292" "Wait... you're... {HeroName}... I remember... I remember you...!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3204282672" "<t=2 d=3>Uurgh... I could... I couldn't beat...<t=5 d=5>... this cursed... c-city..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4218366" "I will NOT be killed here by you, {HeroName}. I am Madame Bellerose, I am an INCARNATE, I WILL survive!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P692084675" "Detective Hopp"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Journal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Journal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2792435315" "You found the missing pieces of David Hazen's journal, along with the key to sealing Mot!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2873043657" "Brilliant work, {HeroName}! I can't believe it... all of this time, we were looking at one half of the puzzle! How could I have not seen this before?!<br><br>Of course you can't banish Mot into the spirit world... that would just be sweeping the problem underneath a rug! You have to hit the creature in its heart, its ability to absorb death and suffering! This is... we have a hope now, {HeroName}, although it's still a long shot. Tielekku can utilize the power of the runes in Dark Astoria and your own Incarnate powers to create the barrier to seal Mot's power. But first, you'll need to free Tielekku, which will involve you getting inside of Mot... which involves you getting to Mot's maw to work with the Sentinel, which <i>then</i> involves you not having Mot's full attention on you.<br><br>There are a lot of ways for this to fail, {HeroName}. but that's what I've been preparing for. It's time for the final battle for our world, and you're at the heart of it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DreamDoctor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page TaskOwnerIntro Text :
"P834715260" "{HeroName}! This is a greater turnout than I ever expected. We have a supply of people on reserve here, if worse comes to worse. Right now the fight is already happening in Mot's graveyard. The Vindicators and the Freedom Phalanx are out there, doing their best to draw Mot's attention away from you.<br><br>Colonel Duray is sending his men on bombing runs, while Apex is leading a squad of Vanguard, Longbow, and PPD on the other side of the graveyard. Arachnos and Longbow are fighting the Pantheon within the city, and even Malta has sent help in the form of their Kronos Titan.<br><br>It's up to you now to get to the heart of Mot's graveyard and do what must be done. You will not be alone, however.  There are several powerful allies who are clearing the area for you to arrive in the graveyard. They're willing to give you back up to get to where you need to be."
// Answer Text :
"P636689647" "Alright, I'm ready to go."
// Answer Text :
"P3765847168" "Tell them to stay back and help the others, I'll handle things from here."
// Page NotTaskOwnerIntroBegin Text :
"P1465057766" "I need to speak to your team leader, {HeroName}. Once we've organized things, speak to me again and we'll begin the assault."
// Page Teleport Text :
"P3447255354" "This world is full of super villains. They want to do evil things like take over the world."
// Page HandleThings Text :
"P4096917700" "Are you sure, {HeroName}? Even with everyone doing their best, there's still nearly an entire horde of Banished Pantheon standing between you and Mot. We could definitely use their help elsewhere... but I'm not sure if even you can handle this on your own.<br><br><color orange>The difficulty of the next part of the mission is extremely high. It is not advised to do the following alone and without any support from NPC allies.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3353777258" "On second thought, I'll take the help."
// Answer Text :
"P1858932963" "I'll handle things, don't worry. I'm ready to go."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Sentinel 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3857886605" "I can feel Mot... pulling away at me... trying to devour me. It knows, {HeroName}, that I have been awoken. My very soul is being pulled into the darkness.<br><br>You must hurry, you must get inside of Mot and end this, once and for all!"
// Answer Text :
"P2780175559" "(Enter the inside of Mot)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Tielekku 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P874046850" "You've come, {HeroName}. You are within the darkness of Mot now, where all who have been absorbed dwell. Those who were weak were already devoured by the beast, while the rest of us have our powers drawn out, empowering the dark god.<br><br>I fear this is truly the end of your civilization... my power, your power, was not enough to halt the beast. It will devour all of those who have stood against it, and then its power will shatter the barrier to the spirit world. The Pantheon of old shall be released, and the poor planet of Earth shall be savaged by them until nothing is left."
// Answer Text :
"P952949247" "There is still hope. We're all still alive, we can get through this."
// Page StillHope Text :
"P144628539" "You would still hope, even after being taken by Mot? Who will save you, {HeroName}?<br><br><color orange>You take a moment and focus your powers while remembering your past, all the memories that have led to this one moment in time. You remember the first time you used your powers, the time spent mastering your abilities. Whether you wanted to use your powers for the good of mankind or for yourself, you remember the desires you had for the present, for the future, that went along with your powers.<br><br>You can feel Mot's power eating away at your memories, tainting them, making it seem like they were all false, that your hopes and dreams were all foolish. But you know better than that. Mot will not stop you, not now, not today! You focus your power and begin to feel Mot's hold on you in the darkness breaking. However, you can see that even your immense power is not enough to break out from the nothingness of Mot. You're almost free, but you'll need the help of those trapped in here to get out!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2523160246" "Tielekku, everyone, focus your power, I just need a little more to get out!"
// Page GiveMeStrength Text :
"P916482812" "<color orange>You feel the power of all those around you swirling about you, pushing you forward. In your mind you can see an image of yourself, bound in the chains Mot has put on you. One by one, the links to the chains begin to shatter from the combination of your power and the power of those around you!<br><br>As the final chains break, you see the image of an old man floating towards you: David Hazen, the man who first fought against the power of Mot. He nods to you as he helps break the final chain that binds you to the darkness of Mot's depths!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P867163013" "(Break free of Mot's control!)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Tielekku2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2930377702" "You did it, {HeroName}! All the souls taken by Mot... you've freed them all! But yet, we still are in the same situation as before... Mot will just simply take them back again.<br><br><color orange>You explain to Tielekku David Hazen's true plan to defeat Mot once and for all.</color><br><br>Of course! It is so simple... yes, I can do that, {HeroName}, give me a moment."
// Answer Text :
"P319425793" "(Wait)"
// Page Next Text :
"P3284451792" "It is done. The barrier begins to erect as we speak, containing Mot. It's all over, {HeroName}, the war against Mot has finally come to an end. I thank you for all of your help and assistance in destroying the beast.<br><br>It is time for me to return to the spirit world. I will never forget what you've done on this day, {HeroName}.<br><br><color orange>With the god-killer sword in hand, you could use this last chance to stab Tielekku and Mot with the sword, taking whatever remains of their powers!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P4111140953" "Goodbye, Tielekku."
// Answer Text :
"P474200924" "(Stab Tielekku and Mot with the God-Killer Sword)"
// Page Peaceful Text :
"P2833775904" "<color orange>Tielekku vanishes, though you can feel an aura around you, as if she has left you with a final blessing to guide you in your journey for some time.</color>"
// Page Attack Text :
"P543705865" "<color orange>You stab Tielekku with the god-killer sword, followed by Mot. You can feel both of their power flowing through you as the blade of the sword shatters! Tielekku collapses to the ground as she vanishes back to the spirit world!</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P22330474" "{Hero.type=hero It's suiting that you would be the one, I assume once again, to be in charge of saving the world.|I know this isn't your normal deal, saving the world and all, but I appreciate you stepping up to the responsibility.} If we're going to do this, we're going to need a literal <i>army</i> of our own to face off against Mot.<br><br>While you've been finding out how to destroy Mot, I've been spreading word of our plight across the world, telling the people that now is the time for us to fight, to put aside our differences. I assumed that if our plans all failed, our last attempt would be for all the powers of the world to throw themselves at Mot in the hopes of wiping it out. But now, we have a new plan.<br><br>I've instructed all those who I've talked to of a time and place to gather. I've requested those of a less... savory attitude to put their villainy aside, and those of a more righteous view to focus on the task at hand. We must all band together to fight the monstrous horde of Mot so that you can get to the Sentinel and destroy the creature from the inside."
// AcceptString :
"P1170183221" "Do you know if anyone actually will help?"
// SendOffString :
"P990657001" "We'll see soon enough, {HeroName}. All we can do now is use the time that has been given to us. We will do what we can with whoever has shown up, but we'll have to hurry. Mot is beginning to consume entire <i>cities</i>, {HeroName}. We've received word that nearly the entire population of Chicago has been absorbed by Mot. We do not know what city could be next.<br><br>With the Sentinel on our side, Mot will have no major individual force to back it up, just a horde of monsters. You will have to carve a path through them and reach the Sentinel, while whoever else shows up provides enough of a distraction that Mot's attention is divided.<br><br>Let us go to the meeting place, {HeroName}, where the fate of the world shall be determined once and for all."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3058850419" "Stop Mot from Devouring the World"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2862272525" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: The World's Final Gambit</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P786907613" "You hear a loud commotion ahead. It looks like plenty of people have showed up to help defend the world in what may possibly be its final hour."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2277171549" "Talk to Dream Doctor to enter the battle"
// Script Variable DisplayText :
"P2114976678" "Banished Pantheon to defeat in order to weaken Mot"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2925883779" "Talk to the Sentinel to go inside Mot"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3343533102" "Speak with Tielekku inside of Mot's darkness"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2265893888" "Speak with Tielekku to bind Mot"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P998468804" "Defeat Tielekku to gain her power"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3571567476" "Now we die..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Badge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable HERO_NAME :
"P2798938803" "Honoree"
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3982272650" "Keep: Control. Able to assist: to best of my abilities."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1738482053" "Nevermind"
// Script Variable HERO_NAME :
"P2808151008" "Lord Recluse"
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P536186480" "Alright, {HeroName}, let's get this over with. I'm not pleased that this is how the situation is ending."
// Script Variable HERO_NAME :
"P4280713698" "Blue Steel"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3305365517" "I haven't forgotten what you've done, {HeroName}. There'll be time later to settle this."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4287227963" "Got your back, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3897560504" "You'll have to take it from here, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable HERO_NAME :
"P846108237" "Super Devoured Pyriss"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3268075727" "I remember... you... {HeroName}... you brought me to... Von Grun... I will... find you when this is... over...!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P451357200" "Arachnos commands me... but I can feel myself... Wanting to do this... wanting to save the world with this... new power...!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4254344464" "It's up to you now, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1043909802" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>This is the Dream Doctor! Today, we all take a stand against the power of Mot!<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>What Mot represents is something that eats away at our very fiber, our very hearts!<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>It is not just death, it is hopelessness! Mot is the despair that we have all felt at one time in our lives!<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Mot would make you think this despair is the Truth, that there is no hope in our lives!<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Whatever side you're on, whatever your goals are, we all have this hope for our dreams, for our desires, to come true, to be fulfilled!<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>We do not fight just against a god of death today, we fight against the very embodiment of despair, of the voice that tells us our desires can never be fulfilled!<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>People of the world, today we make the choice of hope, and that is something Mot can NOT take away, that Mot CAN NOT DEFEAT!<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Stand together and FIGHT, put your hope in {HeroName}, {Hero.type=hero a true hero|despite their villainy}!!"

