// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3193707839" "You defeated one of the Ravagers!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3310431311" "<t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color Maroon><bgcolor Red>You're a fool, {HeroName}. Your hopes... Your dreams... they mean nothing.<t=7 caption x= 0.5 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Maroon><bgcolor Red>You and the rest of humanity are a contradiction. You desire everything, but yet you can never fulfill yourselves. Why do you continue with this?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P140278638" "<t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color Maroon><bgcolor Red>Did you think it would be this easy? You are mine, {HeroName}, you cannot resist my power, not when you are inside of me!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2346149566" "<t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color Maroon><bgcolor Red>What?! This is imPosSible... how did YoU breAK free?!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1630560612" "<t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color Maroon><bgcolor Red>ThIS is nOT...<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.6 d=5><scale 1.75><color Maroon><bgcolor Red>I wiLL NOT<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.6 d=5><scale 1.75><color Maroon><bgcolor Red>be dESTRoYED!!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1429592776" "<t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color Maroon><bgcolor Red>I aM eTERnaL! I CaNNOT... I wiLL NoT be STOpPED!"

